 -- Hidden side/back faces use only measured native wood/soil palette.
 -- The top meets the facade at Z19; explicit ownership preserves its rear
 -- triangles through the later roof replacement. The solid
 -- side walls start at that facade, avoiding coplanar overlap with the
 -- original recessed door jambs behind Z19. The existing cream wall closes
